    <string name="param_risk_danger">A wrong value here can leave the scooter unable to move, or take the battery below its safe voltage. Do not change it unless you know what the right value is for your pack.</string>
    <string name="param_risk_unknown">Nobody has worked out what this does. Changing it is an experiment on your own scooter, and there is no way to read back what it was.</string>
